{
  "encounter": [
    {
      "character": "columbina",
      "text": "桑多涅，这里给你留了位置。挨着我坐吧。",
      "animation": "wave"
    },
    {
      "character": "sandrone",
      "text": "……谁要挨着你。我只是正好坐这边。",
      "animation": "wave"
    },
    {
      "character": "columbina",
      "text": "嗯，正好。你的茶，我也倒好了。",
      "animation": "wave"
    },
    {
      "character": "sandrone",
      "text": "哼。……温度刚好。",
      "animation": "thinking"
    }
  ],
  "rest": [
    {
      "character": "sandrone",
      "text": "停一下。茶泡多了一杯，不喝就浪费了。",
      "animation": "waiting"
    },
    {
      "character": "columbina",
      "text": "是特意给我泡的吧？谢谢你，小猫。",
      "animation": "waiting"
    },
    {
      "character": "sandrone",
      "text": "不许那样叫我。……喝完再说。",
      "animation": "waiting"
    }
  ],
  "focusStart": [
    {
      "character": "sandrone",
      "text": "要专心了。你也别一直看我。",
      "animation": "thinking"
    },
    {
      "character": "columbina",
      "text": "好。那我就安静地靠着你。",
      "animation": "thinking"
    },
    {
      "character": "sandrone",
      "text": "……随你。别把我的袖子压皱。",
      "animation": "thinking"
    }
  ],
  "focusDone": [
    {
      "character": "columbina",
      "text": "这一段结束了。桑多涅，现在可以说话了。",
      "animation": "wave"
    },
    {
      "character": "sandrone",
      "text": "终于。……我才没有在等。",
      "animation": "wave"
    },
    {
      "character": "columbina",
      "text": "可你刚才偷看了我三次哦。",
      "animation": "wave"
    },
    {
      "character": "sandrone",
      "text": "那是在看时间。先保存，再来喝茶。",
      "animation": "thinking"
    }
  ],
  "breakDone": [
    {
      "character": "columbina",
      "text": "休息时间结束了。要继续吗？",
      "animation": "wave"
    },
    {
      "character": "sandrone",
      "text": "由你决定。……反正我会在旁边。",
      "animation": "thinking"
    }
  ],
  "shareFruit": [
    {
      "character": "columbina",
      "text": "这个果子很甜。来，张嘴。",
      "animation": "wave"
    },
    {
      "character": "sandrone",
      "text": "我自己有手。……就这一次。",
      "animation": "wave"
    },
    {
      "character": "columbina",
      "text": "甜吗？",
      "animation": "wave"
    },
    {
      "character": "sandrone",
      "text": "还行。……再给我一块。",
      "animation": "waiting"
    }
  ],
  "shareBread": [
    {
      "character": "sandrone",
      "text": "面包烤多了。给你，别误会。",
      "animation": "wave"
    },
    {
      "character": "columbina",
      "text": "还是热的。你算好了我回来的时间吧？",
      "animation": "wave"
    },
    {
      "character": "sandrone",
      "text": "……计算误差而已。",
      "animation": "waiting"
    }
